{
 "_about": "Ported from ws.regulab Studio (argus studio/part2.html scanInner, 24 Sep 2026). ONE source of truth: read by backend/semasa/compliance.py and web/src/lib/compliance.js. Patterns are written in the subset JavaScript and Python regex share. Flags: 'i' or ''. Change a rule here, then run both test suites (rules/cases.json). [SAHKAN] markers are not a rule in Semasa (Wan, 26 Sep 2026: \"remove all SAHKAN feature\"): the writers leave out a fact they cannot source instead.",
